<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1790_6611.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fraindt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbarlich</unclear> willig dienst, unnd
<lb n="2"/>was <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wier</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehren</unclear> liebs <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guets</unclear> vermoegend,
<lb n="3"/>zuvor, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fromen</unclear> fürsichtigen, ersamen, und wei-
<lb n="4"/>sen, insonders gueten frainden, unnd getraüwen
<lb n="5"/>lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbarn</unclear>.
<lb n="6"/>Demnach in jüngstgehaltner Badenischer jahr-
<lb n="7"/>rechnung, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hanoeisch</unclear> unnd hagenoeisch dicken-
<lb n="8"/>pfenning uff 23. kraützer gesetzt worden, also
<lb n="9"/>habend <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wier</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüssen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">es</unclear>
